--[[
    Level 11 - Lantern Grove
    A forest at dusk. Pressure plates open gates, but only the Big ball is
    heavy enough to press one ("TOO LIGHT!" for the others).
    Hold plates keep their gate open while pressed (and a moment after);
    timer plates start a ticking countdown when pressed.

    1. first plate: grow Big, press the plate, roll through the gate
    2. timer run: press, then hurry over the spike pit before the gate shuts
    3. hollow tree: springs up three ledges, then a timer plate opens the
       hatch above a spring; the key waits at the top
    4. shrink race: press as Big, shrink to Small and roll into the low tunnel
    5. lantern bridge: gaps over the drop (the wide one is too far for Big),
       moths, and a timer gate after one more gap
    6. great gate: two timer plates must be running at the same time;
       then the key door and the flag

    Legend:  . empty   # ground   = planks   ^ spikes   P pump   * gem
             E hedgehog   B moth   S start   G goal   H checkpoint
             J spring   K key   D locked door   L lantern
             a-f plates of group 1-6   1-6 gates of group 1-6
]]

